{"id":"wb-6-523","name":"泰州城隍庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"泰州城隍庙","text":"泰州城隍庙位于中国江苏省泰州市海陵区邑庙街22号，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n泰州城隍庙始建于唐，北宋重修，明正统四年（1439年）重建，清咸丰三年（1853年）再重修。庙坐北朝南，占地面积约5300平方米，建筑面积约2170平方米，有山门、审事厅、大殿、二十四司、东西班房、福神祠、土地祠等建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%B0%E5%B7%9E%E5%9F%8E%E9%9A%8D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":84931237,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84931237","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/752a2038766556f5d4ca50d6.jpg","title":"Suzhou Chenghuang Miao 2015.04.23 17-26-34.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Suzhou_Chenghuang_Miao_2015.04.23_17-26-34.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/Suzhou_Chenghuang_Miao_2015.04.23_17-26-34.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"蘇州府城隍廟","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}